    "notes": [
      "The web logs a refused REST subscribe and acknowledges every item (compositedge_websocket.py:289-292, adapter subscribe), a web defect the desktop does not copy (review R107-03).",
      "The refusal's code and description are made up: no recorded XTS refusal exists; 400 is what the feed reads as a definite refusal (brokers/families/xts/streaming/calls.rs subscription_call). That XTS refuses a whole batch for one instrument is the feed's own assumption (R107-03).",
      "The broker's answers are paced 0.5 s apart, so the reply may take seconds (within_ms)."
    ]
  }
